// comment thumbnail at 1555.5555555555554,1114.3333333333333 748x1807: "CREDITS:\n\n== CODE ==\nImage scanner by @Geotale, remixed by @awesome-llama\nhttps://scratch.mit.edu/projects/643721525/\nhttps://scratch.mit.edu/projects/840839772\n\nTextured triangle filler by @Bambozzle, modified by @KryptoScratcher\nhttps://scratch.mit.edu/projects/826059940/\n\nTriangle Filler by @Chrome_Cat (modified from @-Rex- and @Geotale's projects)\nhttps://scratch.mit.edu/projects/768693019/\n\nPTE by @awesome-llama-test\nhttps://scratch.mit.edu/projects/934459716/\n\nThanks to @Arctenik for ideas and assistance with creating a text-based image format. I didn't directly use their code but it was extremely helpful.\nhttps://scratch.mit.edu/projects/693020370/\nhttps://scratch.mit.edu/projects/788861757/\n\nProject point onto line segment surface by @awesome-llama-test\nhttps://scratch.mit.edu/projects/730817736/\n\nFactory Building 3D by @awesome-llama\nhttps://scratch.mit.edu/projects/773175240/\n\n\n== MUSIC ==\nJameson Nathan Jones: No Shelter\nhttps://jamesonnathanjones.bandcamp.com/track/no-shelter\n\n65daysofstatic - feathers\nhttps://65daysofstatic.bandcamp.com/track/feathers\n\nLuminist - Woodland Shadows\nhttps://soundcloud.com/luministmusic/woodland-shadows\n\nThe Proper People - Ganymede\nhttps://soundcloud.com/theproperpeople/ganymede\n\nFinnian Langham (Infra) - radio 1\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SI39f9JaT2Q\n\n\n== SFX ==\nelevator 06 -  https://freesound.org/s/502344/\ntrain2 motor -  https://freesound.org/s/378673/\nwind - https://freesound.org/s/525292/\nelectric jack - https://freesound.org/s/683808/\nold creaking windmill - https://freesound.org/s/628420/\nspooky garage door - https://freesound.org/s/537832/\nconcrete mixer - https://freesound.org/s/464647/\ncreepy metal creaks - https://freesound.org/s/94111/\nerror - https://freesound.org/people/s/653813/\njet engine - https://freesound.org/s/346034/\nfighter jet - https://freesound.org/s/420560/\nNo Man's Sky\nAll other sounds created by @awesome-llama\n\n\n== TEXTURES ==\nhttps://www.craiyon.com/\nTextures.com\nambientCG\nPolyHaven\ntexture.ninja\n3dtextures.me\n4.7 GB of CC0 Textures for Everyone! compiled by Blender Pirate\n\n\n== SOFTWARE/TOOLS ==\nTurboWarp Desktop\nBlender 3.5 using UV-Packer, SVG Exporter, Quick Mesh Rename, and NGon Loop Select.\npaint.NET\nPython 3.9 using Pillow, Numpy, and Pyperclip.\nVS Code\nPureRef\nNotepad++\nAdobe Illustrator\nAudacity\n7Zip\nImage Editor https://scratch.mit.edu/projects/552647396/\n\n== MISC ==\nSpecial thanks to the 3DGaS group for occasional thoughts and help with developing this project.\nhttps://scratch.mit.edu/studios/32030084/"
// comment thumbnail at 847.2222222222223,1097.5555555555557 683.370361328125x732.77783203125: "v1.4.4\n- prevent selection of high res textures in scratch\n\nv1.4.3\n- fix bug with TextImage (not resetting str)\n\nv1.4.2\n- cleanup\n- better commands\n\nv1.4.1\n- fix floor tri script\n- cleanup\n\nv1.4 2024-10-19\n- font updated to 5x7 Printable ASCII: https://scratch.mit.edu/projects/934459716/\n- internal texture handling now uses TextImage: https://scratch.mit.edu/projects/945312296\n- replaced nostalgia music with feathers, quietened radio 1\n- improved player z calculation (no more precision issues)\n\nv1.3.3c 2024-02-23\n- fixed teleport into base of mast\n\nv1.3.3b 2023-12-24\n- fixed teleport in and out of facility not handling y axis\n- expanded view drill archive to include skipped frame\n- shortened cmd dev display delay to 1.5 sec\n\nv1.3.3 2023-09-08\n- clean up of passcode document text\n- facility map document\n- block cleanup, deletion of unneeded scripts\n\nv1.3.2 2023-07-15\n- 90.001 cam rot z to prevent rendering issue\n- ctrl support for TurboWarp\n"
