// comment cmd at 83.18518518518519,888.9629629629629 918x1196: "`dev [0 | 1]`\nSet the developer mode variable, enables use of other commands and hidden developer tools\n\n`reset`\nReset the game and put it in a project state that can be saved (including showing the thumbnail)\n\n`reload`\nReload the region that is currently loaded\n\n`load [name: str]`\nLoad a region\n\n`rs`\nReset game states and load tags\n\n`res [resolution: num]`\nSet the render resolution\n\n`rm [mode: str]`\nSet the render mode. Modes include: normal, hologram, points, floor, bb, boundary.\n\n`cm [mode: str]`\nSet the camera mode. Modes include: walk, free.\n\n`tp [x: num] [y: num] [z: num]`\nTeleport to a coordinate.\n\n`start`\nStart the game.\n\n`rth`\nReturn to home (teleport to pod region and load).\n\n`lt [low | high]`\nLoad textures.\n\n`doc [name: str]`\nView a document\n\n`gs [key: str] [val: any]`\nSet the game state\n\n`texture`\nOpen the custom texture loader.\n\n`bonus [0 | 1]`\nEnable or disable bonus.\n\n`help`\nPrint a few common commands.\n\n`print [text: str] [duration: num]`\nPrint text on screen."
